## VRM Model Usage

If you use third-party VRM models:
- Respect the model creator's license
- Common licenses: CC0, CC-BY, CC-BY-NC, etc.
- Always credit the original creator
- Do not use for commercial purposes unless permitted
- Check model license on VRoid Hub, Booth, or other sources

## RSS Feed Usage

When using RSS feeds:
- Respect the feed provider's terms of service
- Do not abuse rate limits
- Attribute content to original sources
- Comply with copyright laws

## Image Analysis

When using camera/screen capture with AI:
- Respect user privacy
- Get user consent before capturing
- Don't send sensitive information to external APIs
- Comply with local privacy laws (GDPR, CCPA, etc.)

